            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 27 Column: d</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Represents gas delivered to storage to support system management activity. This footnote also applies to column (c).</span>
          </span>
        </p>
